          "text": "Thoracolumbar back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Severe, constant 8/10 pain, midline T11–L1, right greater than left; sudden onset after a long interstate drive 5 days ago, worse over the last 24–48 hours. Worse with movement, cough, and lying flat; described as deep in the spine rather than muscle and different from prior mechanical low back pain."
      }
